      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216950/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soak cauliflower florets in a large bowl of lightly salted water for 20 minutes. Drain well, then pat dry. Set an oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and preheat the oven's broiler. Line a baking sheet with heavy-duty aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OVrRGYKb4OGFYI31voz4gRXUGOQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216950-roasted-cauliflower-soup-DDMFS-step-02_35954-e2dc3641d522492dbb5740b602dd39ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216950/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange cauliflower in a single layer on the prepared baking sheet; spray evenly with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PMed2X53MiPhdRWQDLNVYGIkqfM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216950-roasted-cauliflower-soup-DDMFS-step-03_35956-83ff341f583e43b0ab301225b92a8be6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216950/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broil in the preheated oven until browned, 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zrjrulVZXLb8xdmOoAdh4wtSvfE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216950-roasted-cauliflower-soup-DDMFS-step-04_35993-7574cb9ae52a4215bd5cbf2af5ae6403.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216950/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large soup pot over medium heat. Add onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir in roasted cauliflower and garlic. Pour in water, season with salt and pepper, and simmer until all vegetables are tender, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
